---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Architecture — CodeContext" description="Understand the CodeContext evidence and intelligence flow.">
  <section class="hero container">
    <span class="kicker">ARCHITECTURE</span>
    <h1>Evidence flows<br /><span>through the system.</span></h1>
    <p>CodeContext separates repository-derived facts from higher-level reasoning so engineering outputs can remain traceable to evidence.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="container pipeline" aria-label="CodeContext architecture flow">
    <div class="node primary"><small>INPUT</small><strong>Repository</strong><span>Source tree · history · changes</span></div>
    <div class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>
    <div class="node"><small>ANALYSIS</small><strong>Repository intelligence</strong><span>Structure · dependencies · architecture · change signals</span></div>
    <div class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>
    <div class="node evidence"><small>GROUNDING</small><strong>Evidence layer</strong><span>Identifiable repository facts and references</span></div>
    <div class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>
    <div class="outputs">
      <div class="node"><small>OUTPUT</small><strong>Repository Q&amp;A</strong><span>Context-aware answers</span></div>
      <div class="node"><small>OUTPUT</small><strong>Engineering Planner</strong><span>Implementation + verification steps</span></div>
      <div class="node"><small>OUTPUT</small><strong>PR Intelligence</strong><span>Review and change context</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container split">
    <article><span class="kicker">01 / DETERMINISTIC</span><h2>Repository facts</h2><p>The repository is analyzed into structured signals before higher-level workflows consume them.</p></article>
    <article><span class="kicker">02 / GROUNDED</span><h2>Traceable context</h2><p>Answers and plans can point back to the evidence available from the analyzed repository.</p></article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .hero { padding: 110px 0 70px; max-width: 920px; }
  .kicker { color: var(--accent); font: 600 .72rem/1.2 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; letter-spacing: .12em; }
  h1 { margin: 18px 0; font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 6rem); line-height: .96; letter-spacing: -.065em; }
  h1 span { color: var(--muted); }
  .hero p { max-width: 720px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.15rem; }
  .pipeline { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
  .node { width: min(720px, 100%); padding: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--panel); display: grid; gap: 6px; }
  .node.primary { border-color: #31536a; background: linear-gradient(120deg, #0e1922, var(--panel)); }
  .node.evidence { border-color: #365f52; }
  .node small { color: var(--muted); font: .68rem ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; letter-spacing: .1em; }
  .node strong { font-size: 1.1rem; }
  .node span { color: var(--muted); font-size: .86rem; }
  .arrow { padding: 8px 0; color: var(--accent); font: 1.3rem ui-monospace, monospace; }
  .outputs { width: min(900px, 100%); display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 10px; }
  .outputs .node { width: auto; }
  .split { margin-top: 90px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 12px; }
  .split article { padding: 30px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--panel); }
  h2 { margin: 12px 0 8px; font-size: 1.6rem; }
  .split p { color: var(--muted); }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { .outputs, .split { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
